===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|hvart}}, from {{m|non|hvar||where}} (whence {{m|is|hvar}}) + {{m|non|at||to}} (whence {{m|is|að}}). The vowel change is probably due to influence from {{m|is|hver}} (neuter ''hvert'').

